# codelists

## glosis_codelist_properties
### ontology
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/html
RewriteRule ^model/codelists/properties/?$ https://glosis-ld.github.io/glosis/glosis_properties/index-en.html [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^model/codelists/properties/?$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/glosis-ld/glosis/refs/heads/master/glosis_properties.ttl [R=302,L]
### Versioned ontology
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/html
RewriteRule ^model/codelists/properties/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)/?$ https://github.com/glosis-ld/glosis/blob/refs/tags/$1/glosis_properties.ttl [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^model/codelists/properties/([0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+)/?$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/glosis-ld/glosis/refs/tags/$1/glosis_properties.ttl [R=302,L]
### terms in def server
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/html
RewriteRule ^model/codelists/properties/(.+)$ https://defs-dev.opengis.net/vocprez-hosted/object?uri=http://w3id.org/glosis/model/codelists/properties/$1 [R=302,L]
#RewriteRule ^model/codelists/properties/(.+)$ https://glosis.isric.org/glosis_cl/en/page/$1 [R=302,L]
RewriteRule ^model/codelists/properties/(.+)$ https://raw.githubusercontent.com/glosis-ld/glosis/refs/heads/master/glosis_properties.ttl [R=302,L]


